1
00:00:00,556 --> 00:00:04,586
Let's get you started with the NADSP E-Badge Academy.

2
00:00:04,586 --> 00:00:09,056
This first step gets your account ready and opens your first badge.

3
00:00:09,543 --> 00:00:15,128
In your email, find the invitation to the NADSP E-Badge Academy.

4
00:00:15,128 --> 00:00:19,944
Open it, follow the invitation link, and create your own password.

5
00:00:21,556 --> 00:00:25,626
Now go to ebadge.nadsp.org and choose Log In.

6
00:00:25,626 --> 00:00:29,628
Your username is the email address that received the invitation,

7
00:00:29,628 --> 00:00:31,572
all in lowercase.

8
00:00:33,056 --> 00:00:35,450
Once you are in, choose Catalog.

9
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:39,227
Find NADSP Certifications for DSPs.

10
00:00:39,227 --> 00:00:43,816
This course tracks your progress toward DSP certification.

11
00:00:44,943 --> 00:00:47,935
Open that course and choose Get It to enroll.

12
00:00:47,935 --> 00:00:52,512
Then return to the catalog for the Code of Ethics Commitment badge.

13
00:00:53,930 --> 00:00:56,616
Open the Code of Ethics Commitment badge.

14
00:00:56,616 --> 00:01:02,946
Read the current NADSP Code of Ethics and the Certification Fraud Policy carefully,

15
00:01:02,946 --> 00:01:06,964
then complete the commitment inside the badge course.

16
00:01:08,556 --> 00:01:12,080
Once you complete that commitment, your first step is done.

17
00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:16,016
If your invitation is missing, or you cannot sign in,

18
00:01:16,016 --> 00:01:19,609
ask your local E-Badge Academy administrator for help.

